 <header>
  <h1 class="entry-title">
   <span>
    13
   </span>
   Sumac Tea
  </h1>
 </header>
 <p>
  <strong>
   <span style="color: #339966">
    Names
   </span>
  </strong>
 </p>
 <p>
  <strong>
   Common Name
  </strong>
  – Sumac
 </p>
 <p>
  <strong>
   Scientific Name
  </strong>
  –
  <em>
   Rhus Glabra
  </em>
 </p>
 <p>
  <strong>
   Other Names
  </strong>
  – nekw’tsamúm’l, Smooth Sumac, White Sumac, Upland Sumac, Scarlet Sumac, smooth horsetail
 </p>
